        "text": "The speaker is grateful for all active-duty military personnel including airmen, soldiers, guardians, marines, sailors, and Coast Guardsmen.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "Civilian control of the military is intentional and designed into the U.S. constitutional framework.",
        "confidence": 0.97
